{"name":"Cherry Cordial","hex":"#ebbed3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cherry","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small fruit, usually red, black or yellow, with a smooth hard seed and a short hard stem.","Prunus subg. Cerasus, trees or shrubs that bear cherries."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Containing or having the taste of cherries.","Of a bright red color; cherry red."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cherry"},{"term":"cordial","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Hearty; sincere; warm; affectionate.","Radiating warmth and friendliness; genial."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A concentrated non-carbonated soft drink which is diluted with water before drinking.","An individual serving of such a diluted drink."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cordial"}],"entries":[{"title":"Chocolate-covered cherry","blocks":[{"text":"Chocolate-covered cherries are a dessert confection. Variations include cherry cordials with liquid fillings often including cherry liqueur, as well as chocolate-covered candied cherries and chocolate-covered dried cherries."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Cella-Chocolate-Cherries.jpg/330px-Cella-Chocolate-Cherries.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate-covered_cherry","wikidata":"Q16242001"},{"title":"Cordial (candy)","blocks":[{"text":"A cordial is a type of confection in which liquid filling is placed within a chocolate shell. A well known confectionery of this type is the cherry cordial."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Cherry_cordial_%28candy%29.JPG/330px-Cherry_cordial_%28candy%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cordial_(candy)","wikidata":"Q5169969"},{"title":"Cordial (medicine)","blocks":[{"text":"A cordial is any in